                        'A'.</p><p>Partly erased inscr. on fol. 1v: 'liber Thome Howlande monachi
                        Sancti Cuthberti Dunelm. Si quis ipsum alienauerit vel alienari fecerit
                        anathema sit hoc est maledictionem apostolorum petri et pauli incurrat. Amen
                        Amen Amen.'</p><p>(Medieval red leather binding.)</p><p>Eight cautiones,
                        dated 1481, 1467, 1455, 1471, 1464, 1459, 1463, on endleaves; the book lay
                        in the Winton, 'donkan' and 'Gilford' chests. In 1463 R. Ebchester (prior of
                        Durham College), redeemed it.</p><q type="pressmark">A</q></provenance>
